      <description>I&amp;rsquo;m a Data Science PhD student at New York University and a member of ML² Group at CILVR. I&amp;rsquo;m co-advised by Sam Bowman and Kyunghyun Cho.
Prior to NYU, I developed Information Retrieval and Extraction Systems at Institute of High Performance Computing in Singapore. Before that, I earned my bachelor&amp;rsquo;s degree in Computer Science with specialization in Information Systems at Nanyang Technological University where I worked with Bingsheng He on Text Mining.</description>
